[PrintTextModified Text:在梅露露准备便当的时候，<br>艾玛决定去叫雪莉和汉娜。|#0103Adv05_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（今天是放松的日子，换个心情好好享受吧！）|#0103Adv05_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可没走几步，<br>刚才见到的亚里沙的样子就浮现在脑海中。|#0103Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（好久没见到亚里沙了呢。<br>　不知道玛格和可可她们在做什么……？）|#0103Adv05_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2

[PrintTextModified Text:……好！|#0103Adv05_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛抬起头，眼神中闪烁着坚定的光芒。|#0103Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不只是叫上雪莉和汉娜，<br>　要把大家都邀请来！）|#0103Adv05_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

